1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Johan Christiersson, born 1630, Frostkåge nr 13, Skellefteå parish, Västerbotten (Västerbottens län). DNA verified via at least two sons, belonging to haplogroup R1a1a1a (L664) > S2894 > YP285 > YP282 > YP441 > YP4
