1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Gudmund was born Sep. 1697 in Gillberga, Värmlands to Nils Andersson and Elisabeth Hansdotter; godparent Lt. Nils Litterbiorn, according to C:1.245 (1693-1720). He married (1) before 1736 to a woman who's name is u
2 CONC nknown (she would be Cecilia Gudmundsdotter's mother). They had three children: (1) s. Daniel  1735, (2) d. Ingeborg 1737, and husband Zach Pehrsson 1736 at Bjänsfors 1, Bygdeå, and (3) d. Coecilia 1736, and husband Nate H. with h
2 CONC er in-laws Hans L. and K. L
2 CONT
2 CONT He married (2) Marta Larsdotter, step-mother to 8 year old Cecilia, 1743-10-30. Shown with wife #2 Marta Larsdotter (b. 1710), and kids at Bjännsjöa 1, Bygdeå, AI:2.55 (1746-52)  and AI:3.95 (1762-72). He lived to 88 years, when h
2 CONC e died of gulsot (jaundice).
2 CONT
2 CONT Dombok (Court Judgment Book) Dmb 1754 /18/3: request to build a sawmill in Bjänsjöå.
2 CONT
2 CONT His mother-in-law (2nd marriage) Brita Larsdotter died 1760-01-08 at age 90 years.
2 CONT Dombok (Court Judgment Book) Dmb 1758 /4: the board certified that the widow Brita Larsdotter from Frostkåge village in Skellefteå parish, who currently resides at Gudmund Nilsson's in Bjänsjöå, is quite poor and mostly bedridden 
2 CONC due to illness.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources:.
2 CONT Kråken 24 database person 158755 , https://kråken.se/ gives death source C:2 (age apparently incorrect). Bygdeå HFL AI:2.55 (1755-62) shows him b. 1695; HFL Bjensjö, Bygdeå AI:2.55 (1755-62) nybyggare (settler) b. 1695. "But accor
2 CONC ding to dödbok, he is 88 years old when he dies in 1766, i.e. born in 1678 (a full 17 years earlier)."
2 CONT https://www.geni.com/people/Gudmund-Nilsson/6000000023486187836
2 CONT "Agneta Olofsson, "Bygdeå Byar och Gårdar," p. 390, Bjänsjöa,"
2 CONT Long discussion about Gudmund Nilsson on Anbytarforum, https://forum.rotter.se/index.php?topic=36776.0
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Agneta Olofsson, BYGDEÅ BYAR OCH GÅRDAR, 391, BJÄNSJÖÅ
2 CONT
2 CONT Dmb1754 /18/3 anhålles om att få bygga en sågqvarn i Bjänsjöå..
2 CONT
