1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Mariet Hansdotter, born in Bureå, Skellefteå landsförsamling, was at Öndebyn, Bygdeå in 1625.
2 CONT
2 CONT Johan Bure's släktbok, copy X37 "Wife: Mariet [of] Matz Öriesons in Öndebyn in Bygde[å]." Johan Bure's family book, copy X37, op. 8 (cited by Sikeborg).
2 CONT
