1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Born in Röbäck, Umeå landsförs., AI:3.96 (1762), baptism 1803-07-05 The mother's name is given as Dordi Eriksdotter (Kråken 144930, Dordi).
2 CONT Marriage shown at C:2.170. Marriage book shows him as a Dräng (farmhand) from Bjänfors.
2 CONT Shown with father Hans L., stepmom Kjerstin L., and wife Coeilia Gudmundsdotter, at father's farm, Bjansfors1, Bygdeå, AI:2.55 and AI:3.97 (1762-72) . Then shown with wife Coeilia G., kids, and retired parents at Bjänsfors 1, Bygd
2 CONC eå, AI:4.37 (1771-1794). Residences: Bjänfors, Bjänsjafors, Gjansjoa, Bjänsjofors, and Åkullsjön, Bydgeå.
2 CONT
2 CONT Nathaniel H. dies; Cecilia OK at Åkullsjön 1 farm, with son Nils, his wife, and kids, AI:6.81 (1797-1807). Death and burial record, C:3.628: died in Bjänfors, Bygdeå; settler (nybyggare), 1803-05-28, 66 yrs old, of Tumor/growth/sw
2 CONC elling in intestine and chest ("Svullnad in mage och brost"). Widow Cecilia Gudmundsdotter survives him; living with son Nils N. in Åkullsjön; then she dies at age 85.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources:
2 CONT Birth & baptism, 9 & 10 Jan 1937, Umeå landsförsamling (AC) C:2 (1736-1756) Image 42 / Page 69 (AID: v139888.b42.s69, NAD: SE/HLA/1010219), https://app.arkivdigital.se/volume/v139888?image=42
2 CONT Bygdeå Parish records: C2.170 (marriage), C3.628 (death), HFL AI.3.96 (1762) (birth).
2 CONT Bygdeå parish HFL, AI:3.96 (1762) (AID: v139095.b43.s97, NAD: SE/HLA/1010025), https://app.arkivdigital.se/volume/v139095?image=43
2 CONT Bygdeå parish HFL, AI:4.37 (1771-1794) (AID: v139096.b51.s37, NAD: SE/HLA/1010025), https://app.arkivdigital.se/volume/v139096?image=51
2 CONT Kråken 13 person 144960, https://kråken.se/ gives sources "DB,HFL" for birth and "SLJ" for death; HFL: Gravmark, Umeå AI:5,3/3,p. 191 (1741-51) and AI:6,8/10,p.231 (1751-58).
